{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0354_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3a8365a7cc5aa4a794b7cc7d3d0e3bd3d7e604904796d5b625eba46aeda31287", "ja": "（仕事も一段落したし、ちょっと休憩を入れよう。\nえーっと、何を飲もうかな……）", "zh": "（工作也告一段落了，稍微休息一下吧。\n嗯……喝点什么好呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0354_1001_044miz", "source_sha256": "a7bd974465688225851653b3f2a9ebb0a30e80398225dfb1097cfdc03513ed22", "ja": "失礼します。……あ、お疲れさまです。\n{$P$}。", "zh": "打扰了。……啊，辛苦了。\n{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0354_1002_p", "source_sha256": "b78183e40b148584872ab7aba6314d985b12b58bfebad2d47bbccfc8bf773dd0", "ja": "瑞希？　あれ、今日はオフじゃなかったか？", "zh": "瑞希？咦，你今天不是休息日吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0354_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "072efb17cc6719b7af42af9cf8b5d9ab9e8676f3aa1656e21eb7dfd9797586a2", "ja": "はい。今日はオフ。休みを満喫する日……\nでしたが、台本を忘れたことに気づいてしまいました。", "zh": "是的。今天休息。是享受假期的一天……\n不过，我发现自己把剧本忘了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0354_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "b8c399ee1e9969821793a8a5f5797408af94845f5ed5545b0702f413a4daf62c", "ja": "こうして、遠路はるばる取りにきたというわけです。\n……うっかりだぞ、瑞希。", "zh": "所以，我才不远千里赶来取。\n……真是粗心啊，瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0354_1005_p", "source_sha256": "ec2e4859ca67cc445db56a5882a37df02bc30fa789ec0f256eeff87e266515d5", "ja": "そうだったのか。せっかく寒空の中、来たんだ。\nホットショコラでもごちそうしようか。", "zh": "原来如此。你特意冒着寒风过来，就请你喝杯热巧克力吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0354_1006_044miz", "source_sha256": "12dbf553e46fd68c327699ca16eee8a15304d85f6b08ce932dd242cb9ec53d73", "ja": "いいんですか？　『棚からぼたもち』ならぬ、\n『劇場からホットショコラ』です。……ラッキー。", "zh": "可以吗？这不是“天上掉馅饼”，\n而是“剧场掉热巧克力”呢。……真走运。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0354_1007_044miz", "source_sha256": "1eedfdb17e75369b733737fcb7826acc5dd7fa3dcf6598bba81bc61c134c4910", "ja": "ごちそうさまでした。……おや？　そんなに見つめて、\nどうかしましたか？　まさか私に告白を……ぽっ。", "zh": "多谢款待。……哎呀？一直盯着我看，是怎么了吗？难道是要向我告白……脸、脸红了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0354_1008_p", "source_sha256": "9282f48488ad1187234b685b568df5ec8e820c2a2598f04a21628f28394378df", "ja": "告白ではないが……私服姿が新鮮だと思ったんだよ。\n普段は制服を着てることが多いから。", "zh": "倒不是告白……只是觉得你穿便服的样子挺新鲜的。\n因为你平时大多都穿着制服。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0354_1009_044miz", "source_sha256": "7d317a0784f45f0d249435dc70fd0d94e3acd7dd51b88170034a93855009c351", "ja": "おお。よくぞお気づきで。\nここまで何も反応がなかったので、ドキドキしました。", "zh": "哦，居然注意到了，真是好眼力。一直到现在都没有任何反应，可让我紧张得心怦怦跳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0354_1010_044miz", "source_sha256": "60094e949ab86e537b25565119a7edec9e96f6e5ac43c434726663bd8bb46fc4", "ja": "もしかしたら、{$P$}がいるかも\nしれないと気づき、渾身の一着を着てみました。", "zh": "我意识到{$P$}或许会在这里，所以穿上了我最用心挑选的一套衣服。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0354_1011_p", "source_sha256": "37ffaaafa3f689d518ae43fecd2abc684b77eeaec90f31ddebdcb38551378d60", "ja": "なるほど。瑞希なりに気合いの入った服なんだな。\n髪型も相まって、とってもカワイイよ。", "zh": "原来如此。这身衣服很有瑞希的风格，也能看出你下了一番功夫。\n配上这个发型，真的特别可爱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0354_1012_044miz", "source_sha256": "3b7c0c87745c445dd16128f0d9eb24a94bfb10cbbe0af3397b7e5d4d03bf1d8c", "ja": "ありがとうございます。さすが店員さんのお墨つき。\n喜んでいただけたようで、私も嬉しいです。", "zh": "谢谢。果然有店员的认可就是不一样。\n看起来您很喜欢，我也很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0354_1013_044miz", "source_sha256": "3ee96d6cb4271b03416cff331a3268fd8afe83d579a214897513d7bded315d0e", "ja": "でも、そんなにストレートに褒められるとは思わず。\n……テレテレ。", "zh": "不过，没想到会被这么直白地夸奖。\n……怪不好意思的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0354_1014_p", "source_sha256": "c5e1127e382bb06e4f0a309f30f413fa452d9859e3d85e1ab3d064cc67da6e8c", "ja": "なあ、瑞希。今後の衣装の参考にしたいから、\nもう少し服のことを聞いてもいいか？", "zh": "喂，瑞希。为了作为今后服装的参考，能再问你一些关于服装的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0354_1015_044miz", "source_sha256": "fb611c8a6b81163fbd165c9cdc49a4c0a73d96c22fe0e8c252b2089e6fd8f50d", "ja": "はい、もちろんです。{$P$}も、\nもっと詳しく感想を聞かせてください。", "zh": "好的，当然可以。也请{$P$}再详细说说感想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0354_1016_044miz", "source_sha256": "6009cfa7710e7d096f6a0996d25355e8e0c68322bc2eadeb338546f84aede2c3", "ja": "恥ずかしさもありますが、私も参考にしたいです。\n……ワクワク。", "zh": "虽然会觉得不好意思，但我也想参考一下。\n……满心期待。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0354_1017_p", "source_sha256": "2032c35260e7c64ebb2402afbc88817eb2cfe49638ea01b0d019687b283d5de9", "ja": "ああ、わかったよ。\nその前に、ホットショコラのおかわりはどうだ？", "zh": "啊，知道了。\n在那之前，要不要再来一杯热巧克力？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0354_1018_044miz", "source_sha256": "53835917d0519226a9b02d81829067bb8fb38cbe0c47425c3152cb519c02b643", "ja": "はい、いただきます。……ふふ。\n今日はツイてないと思っていましたが、大逆転です。", "zh": "好的，我就不客气了……呵呵。\n本来还以为今天运气不佳，没想到来了个大逆转。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0354_1019_044miz", "source_sha256": "04e3990bf46cb660d7130d3d2fc69fdb7d823e16043123ceb5f84f6ad5fb5b9c", "ja": "ありがとうございます、{$P$}。\nおかげで、最高のオフになりそうです。", "zh": "谢谢您，{$P$}。\n托您的福，感觉会度过一个最棒的休息日。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
